[2026-10-26 19:48:26] [INFO] [map] POPUP show tag=DIPLO_TALK kind=choice title="-" ctx=(a=0 b=2 payload=1) body=""We note that you have signed a treaty with those unrepentant heretics, the {Dutch}.  We {request} that you cancel this treaty at once."" choices=[1]"Never! The {Dutch} are our friends!" [2]"Yes! We shall crush the foul-smelling {Dutch} together!"
