[2026-10-26 19:48:43] [INFO] [map] POPUP show tag=DIPLO_TALK kind=message title="-" ctx=(a=0 b=2 payload=0) body=""{Mighty} Discoverer Walter Raleigh, we again welcome you to {New Spain}. Please remember that we have justly claimed all of this land in the name of {the Pope and the Spanish Crown}.  We continue in our efforts to {convert the heathen} and enrich our Sovereign.""
